===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Nl-immer.ogg|Audio|lang=nl}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|immer||always}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|iomer||always}}. From {{compound|nl|ie|meer|t1=always|t2=more}}. Related to {{m|nl|ieder}}, {{m|nl|iemand}}, {{m|nl|iets}}, {{m|nl|ooit}}. Cognate with German {{m|de|immer}}.

===Adverb===
{{nl-adv}}

# {{lb|nl|formal}} [[always]]

